research/audit/wave12-refuter-tasks/def-vector-valued-derivative-and-integral.md-2608-title: "Sums, scalar multiples, products and quotients: $(f+g)'(c) = f'(c) + g'(c)$, $(\\alpha f)'(c) = \\alpha f'(c)$, $(fg)'(c) = f'(c)g(c) + f(c)g'(c)$, and $(f/g)'(c) = \\bigl(f'(c)g(c) - f(c)g'(c)\\bigr)/g(c)^{2}$ when $g(c) \\ne 0$"
